// Port of libretro slang-shaders crt/shaders/hyllian/crt-hyllian-fast.slang (preset
// crt/crt-hyllian-fast.slangp: this shader alone, filter_linear0 = false -> point sampling).
// Original header:
/*
   Hyllian's CRT Shader
   with cgwg's magenta/green dotmask
   ported to GLSL/SLANG by DariusG & hunterk

   Copyright (C) 2011-2015 Hyllian - sergiogdb@gmail.com

